--
^warning: ignoring
Invariant check failed
--
With an SMT back end without floating-point theory, float_bvt checked the
stage index of normalization_shift against the width of the exponent before
it was extended, and thus failed an invariant ("depth must be smaller than
exponent bits") for these formats.
